<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Community Development – REACT</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --blue: #3f5fc0;
        --blue-dark: #2d4aad;
        --grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a6bd6 0%, #7b4fc9 100%);
        --grad-hero: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a6bd6 0%, #9b59c9 100%);
        --white: #ffffff;
        --bg: #f8f9fc;
        --text: #333344;
        --text-muted: #666680;
        --border: rgba(63, 95, 192, 0.1);
      }


      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }


      body {
        font-family: "Nunito Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }


      /* NAV */
      nav {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        z-index: 100;
        background: var(--white);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0 48px;
        height: 64px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(63, 95, 192, 0.08);
      }
      .nav-logo {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--blue-dark);
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        list-style: none;
      }
      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--blue);
      }


      /* HERO */
      .hero {
        min-height: 38vh;
        background: var(--grad-hero);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 100px 48px 48px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(
            ellipse 60% 50% at 15% 25%,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0%,
            transparent 55%
          ),
          radial-gradient(
            ellipse 50% 60% at 85% 75%,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 0%,
            transparent 55%
          );
      }
      .hero-grid-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 56px 56px;
      }
      .hero-eyebrow {
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        position: relative;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--white);
        line-height: 1.1;
        position: relative;
      }
      .hero-sub {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        position: relative;
      }


      /* INTRO */
      .intro {
        background: var(--white);
        padding: 40px 80px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .intro p {
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.9;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 400;
      }


      /* INITIATIVES */
      .initiatives {
        padding: 56px 80px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 40px;
      }


      /* CARD ROW */
      .init-card {
        background: var(--white);
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(63, 95, 192, 0.07);
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(24px);
        transition:
          opacity 0.55s ease,
          transform 0.55s ease;
      }
      .init-card.reverse {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 200px;
      }
      .init-card.visible {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }


      /* SMALL IMAGE */
      .init-img {
        width: 200px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
      }
      .init-card.reverse .init-img {
        order: 2;
      }
      .init-img img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
      }
      .init-card:hover .init-img img {
        transform: scale(1.05);
      }


      /* CONTENT */
      .init-content {
        padding: 32px 36px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .init-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .init-num {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--grad);
        color: var(--white);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .init-title {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--blue-dark);
      }
      .init-divider {
        width: 32px;
        height: 3px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: var(--grad);
      }
      .init-text {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.85;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      .list-label {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--blue-dark);
      }
      .item-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 7px;
      }
      .item-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 9px;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .item-list li .dot {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-top: 7px;
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--grad);
      }
      .item-list li strong {
        color: var(--blue-dark);
      }
      .arrow-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
      }
      .arrow-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .arrow-list li::before {
        content: "›";
        color: var(--blue);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }


      /* CTA */
      .contact-bar {
        background: var(--grad);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 52px 48px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .contact-bar::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(
          ellipse 60% 80% at 50% 50%,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0%,
          transparent 70%
        );
      }
      .contact-bar h2 {
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--white);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        position: relative;
      }
      .contact-bar p {
        font-size: 14.5px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        position: relative;
      }
      .cta-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--white);
        color: var(--blue);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 13px 36px;
        border-radius: 40px;
        position: relative;
        transition:
          transform 0.2s,
          box-shadow 0.2s;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      }
      .cta-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }


      footer {
        background: var(--white);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 18px 48px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      footer strong {
        color: var(--blue-dark);
        font-weight: 700;
      }


      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        nav {
          padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }
        .intro {
          padding: 32px 24px;
        }
        .initiatives {
          padding: 36px 20px;
          gap: 24px;
        }
        .init-card,
        .init-card.reverse {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .init-card.reverse .init-img {
          order: 0;
        }
        .init-img {
          width: 100%;
          height: 180px;
        }
        .init-content {
          padding: 24px 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- NAV -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">
          <img
            src="/images/logo.jpeg"
            alt="REACT Logo"
            style="
              height: 45px;
              width: auto;
              vertical-align: middle;
              margin-right: 0.4rem;
            "
          />REACT
        </div>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/login">Login</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/programs">Programs</a></li>
        <li><a href="/projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="/user">Events</a></li>
        <li><a href="/register">Get Involved</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>


    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid-bg"></div>
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">REACT — Madurai</p>
      <h1>Community Development</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Building a Stronger, More Inclusive Madurai</p>
    </section>


    <!-- INTRO -->
    <div class="intro">
      <p>
        Our Community Development Programs are designed to strengthen the
        support systems and foster greater inclusion for individuals with
        disabilities across Madurai. We work with various stakeholders to build
        capacity, raise awareness, and provide direct support. Our key
        initiatives within this program include
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- INITIATIVES -->
    <section class="initiatives">
      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="init-card">
        <div class="init-img">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588072432836-e10032774350?w=400&q=80"
            alt="Special School Support"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="init-content">
          <div class="init-header">
            <div class="init-num">01</div>
            <div class="init-title">Special School Support</div>
          </div>
          <div class="init-divider"></div>
          <p class="init-text">
            Recognizing the crucial role of special schools in the ecosystem,
            our Community Development Program focuses on enhancing their
            capacity to provide quality education and support to students with
            disabilities in Madurai. We offer a comprehensive assessment and
            improvement framework to elevate their service standards.
          </p>
          <div class="list-label">Our Assessment Process:</div>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Physical Infrastructure:</strong> Evaluating the
                accessibility and suitability of the school's physical
                environment.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Curriculum:</strong> Reviewing the relevance and
                adaptability of the educational content.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Method of Delivery:</strong> Analyzing the effectiveness
                and inclusivity of teaching methodologies.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Staff Quality:</strong> Assessing the qualifications,
                training, and support provided to educators and staff.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Administration Procedures:</strong> Examining the
                efficiency and inclusivity of the school's operational
                processes.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>


      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="init-card reverse">
        <div class="init-img">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580582932707-520aed937b7b?w=400&q=80"
            alt="School Improvement Solutions"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="init-content">
          <div class="init-header">
            <div class="init-num">02</div>
            <div class="init-title">School Improvement Solutions</div>
          </div>
          <div class="init-divider"></div>
          <p class="init-text">
            Following a thorough assessment, our specialized team provides
            cost-effective and practical solutions tailored to the unique needs
            of each special school, ultimately aiming to improve the overall
            quality of education and support for students with disabilities in
            Madurai.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>


      <!-- 03 -->
      <div class="init-card">
        <div class="init-img">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?w=400&q=80"
            alt="Milestone Development Center"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="init-content">
          <div class="init-header">
            <div class="init-num">03</div>
            <div class="init-title">Milestone Development Center</div>
          </div>
          <div class="init-divider"></div>
          <p class="init-text">
            Our Milestone Development Center in Madurai offers specialized
            therapy and academic support for children facing developmental
            delays, including Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD),
            Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD), Intellectual
            Disability (ID), and Multiple Disabilities. We believe in a holistic
            approach that involves the active participation of parents in their
            child's developmental journey.
          </p>
          <div class="list-label">Our Comprehensive Approach:</div>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>360-Degree Assessment:</strong> Our experienced
                counselors and therapists conduct a thorough evaluation of the
                child, including detailed discussions with parents and
                caregivers, and observation in familiar environments.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Individualized 12-Month Goal Sheet:</strong> Based on
                the assessment, we create a personalized goal sheet focusing on
                five key domains: Activities of Daily Living (ADL), Speech,
                Sensory Processing, Social Interaction, and Academic skills.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Tailored Activity Sheets:</strong> We develop specific
                activity sheets aligned with the individual goals, ensuring
                daily engagement in individual, group, and cognitive activities
                targeting a particular domain.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Monthly Progress Measurement:</strong> We meticulously
                track the child's progress on a monthly basis to identify areas
                of growth and potential challenges.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>Progress Report and Corrective Steps:</strong> Regular
                reports are shared with parents, and collaborative discussions
                lead to necessary adjustments and corrective steps to ensure
                continuous development.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>


      <!-- 04 -->
      <div class="init-card reverse">
        <div class="init-img">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540575467063-178a50c2df87?w=400&q=80"
            alt="Disability Inclusion Webinars"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="init-content">
          <div class="init-header">
            <div class="init-num">04</div>
            <div class="init-title">Disability Inclusion Webinars</div>
          </div>
          <div class="init-divider"></div>
          <p class="init-text">
            As part of our commitment to building an inclusive Madurai
            community, REACT conducts a monthly webinar series on disability
            inclusion. These webinars aim to raise awareness, dispel
            misconceptions, and empower individuals with disabilities and their
            support networks.
          </p>
          <div class="list-label">
            Key Topics Covered: Our webinars delve into various aspects of
            disability, including:
          </div>
          <ul class="arrow-list">
            <li>Strategies for leading an independent life.</li>
            <li>
              The importance and benefits of inclusion in all spheres of
              society.
            </li>
            <li>The critical need for proper and accessible education.</li>
            <li>
              The advantages and support systems available through group living
              arrangements.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="contact-bar">
      <h2>Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>
      <p>
        Join us in creating lasting change in our community. Let's work together
        to build a more inclusive and accessible world for everyone.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="cta-btn">GET INVOLVED</a>
    </div>


    <footer>
      <strong
        >The site is managed by Resource Education And Charitable Trust -
        Madurai</strong
      >
    </footer>


    <script>
      const cards = document.querySelectorAll(".init-card");
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add("visible");
          });
        },
        { threshold: 0.1 },
      );
      cards.forEach((c) => observer.observe(c));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
